      "message": "fix(post): refuse a bore dwell where G86 has no dwell word; pin G86 per post (#1445)\n\nThe Fanuc-family posts and sinumerik wrote P<ms> on G86. The published\nFanuc and Haas G86 formats have no P word, so the control dropped the\ndwell without a message. These posts now refuse a bore with a dwell by\nname. tormach and grblhal keep G86 P<seconds> (LinuxCNC form). A bore\nwith no dwell posts as before; no existing golden changes.\n\nA drilling dwell outside 0..3600 s is refused by name in\nCreateOperation and EditOperationParams (and so MCP edit_operation).\n\nPinned by crates/post/tests/bore_cycle.rs (new goldens in\ntests/golden/bore/) and crates/app/tests/bore_cycle.rs.\n\nRefs #1445\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
